<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ webserver_nginx_site_title }}</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
    body {
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      margin: 0; padding: 3rem 1rem; line-height: 1.6;
      background: #f6f7f9; color: #1b1d21;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      body { background: #121417; color: #e7e9ec; }
      .card { background: #1b1e23 !important; border-color: #2b2f36 !important; }
      td { border-color: #2b2f36 !important; }
      th { color: #9aa3ad !important; }
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e3e6ea; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem;
    }
    h1 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    th, td { text-align: left; padding: .5rem .25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e6ea; }
    th { width: 14rem; font-weight: 600; color: #5b636d; font-size: .9rem; }
    code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .9em; }
    .pill {
      display: inline-block; padding: .15rem .6rem; border-radius: 999px;
      background: #e8f3ec; color: #1d6b3e; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <span class="pill">deploy via Ansible Automation Platform</span>
    <h1>{{ webserver_nginx_site_title }}</h1>
    <p>
      Questa pagina è stata scritta dal ruolo
      <code>acea.suse_aws.webserver_nginx</code>, eseguito da AAP e collegato
      alla VM <strong>senza SSH</strong>: la sessione passa da AWS Systems
      Manager e i file transitano su un bucket S3 dedicato.
    </p>

    <table>
      <tr><th>Instance ID</th><td><code>{{ ansible_aws_ssm_instance_id | default(inventory_hostname) }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><th>Nome EC2</th><td>{{ ec2_name | default('n/d') }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Hostname</th><td>{{ ansible_facts.fqdn }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Distribuzione</th><td>{{ ansible_facts.distribution }} {{ ansible_facts.distribution_version }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Kernel</th><td><code>{{ ansible_facts.kernel }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><th>Architettura</th><td>{{ ansible_facts.architecture }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>IP privato</th><td><code>{{ ansible_facts.default_ipv4.address | default('n/d') }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><th>Regione AWS</th><td>{{ aws_region | default('n/d') }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Connessione Ansible</th><td><code>{{ ansible_connection }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><th>Ultimo deploy</th><td>{{ '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S' | strftime }} UTC</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Referente</th><td>{{ webserver_nginx_owner }}</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
